+  "clean_statement": "For a commutative ring $R$ containing $\\mathbb{Q}$, $m\\geq1$, and $Y=(y_1,\\ldots,y_n)$, is the reduction map $\\operatorname{SAut}_{R[t]}(R[t][Y])\\to\\operatorname{SAut}_{R[t]/(t^m)}(R[t]/(t^m)[Y])$ surjective, where $\\operatorname{SAut}$ denotes polynomial automorphisms with Jacobian determinant $1$?",
